{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26675","headline":"寄绦州李使君 · 姚合","name":"寄绦州李使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独施清静化，千里管横汾。\n黎庶应深感，朝庭亦细闻。\n心期在黄老，家事是功勳。\n物外须仙侣，人间要使君。\n花多匀地落，山近满厅云。\n戎客无因去，西看白日曛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26675.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26675","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}